        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:ICn">I Cn</ref> 22.2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Crist sylf sang Pater noster ærest ⁊ þæt gebed his leorni[n]gcnihtum teahte.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Christ himself first recited the Pater Noster and taught the prayer to his disciples.</ab>
